# CHECK: mlir/secret-logging-checkpoint/fixed/secret_logging_checkpoint.fixed.mlir: fixture MLIR has no sibling snapshot.yaml
# CHECK: mlir/alloca-size/high-count-unknown/snapshot.yaml: secret[0] argument index 99 is out of range
# CHECK: mlir/audience-mismatch/bad/snapshot.yaml: secret[0] name must match argument 0 ('logits')
# CHECK: mlir/breach-compressed-length/bad/snapshot.yaml: cannot parse strict snapshot YAML: aliases, anchors, and explicit tags are not allowed
# CHECK: mlir/breach-compressed-length/fixed/snapshot.yaml: cannot parse strict snapshot YAML: aliases, anchors, and explicit tags are not allowed
# CHECK: mlir/clangover-poly-frommsg/source/snapshot.yaml: expect has an unknown value
# CHECK: mlir/dynamic-kv-length/bad/snapshot.yaml: cannot parse strict snapshot YAML:
# CHECK: mlir/dynamic-kv-length/fixed/snapshot.yaml: snapshot fields must contain exactly
# CHECK: mlir/kyberslash1-poly-tomsg/bad/snapshot.yaml: a completed SPS state requires bitcode, manifest, and report
# CHECK: mlir/kyberslash1-poly-tomsg/bad/snapshot.yaml: non-not-run SPS states remain disabled until the production verifier validates the report
# CHECK: mlir/redis-pool-reuse/bad/snapshot.yaml: snapshot must have exactly one sibling .mlir file
# CHECK: mlir/redis-pool-reuse/fixed/snapshot.yaml: finding: violation requires expect: unknown
# CHECK: mlir/redis-pool-reuse/fixed/snapshot.yaml: finding: violation requires a PREFLIGHT FINDING block
# CHECK: mlir/secret-logging-checkpoint/bad/snapshot.yaml: public[0] argument 0 is not pointer-typed
# CHECK: mlir/wrong-party-plaintext/bad/wrong_party_plaintext.bad.mlir: preflight fixture forbids authoritative field '// model status:'
